# §11.4.30 / CONST-053 repository hygiene.
#
# Model weights (WAN 2.2 5B/14B + LTX-Video 13B transformers + T5/UMT5, tens of
# GB) are NEVER versioned — they are third-party HuggingFace artefacts pulled on
# demand. §11.4.77 regeneration mechanism: .gitignore-meta/wan_ltx_gguf.yaml
# (download from the cited HF repos) + the harness setup step.
models/
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth

# Generated video scratch (never versioned; curated evidence -> docs/qa/<run-id>/).
*.mp4

# Python caches / build artefacts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
